# (BERLIN) the black keys in normal playing: an effect each while held (Take-off, Supernova, Twitter, Repeat, Swell,
# Freeze, Octave, Return, Rise, Close, Transpose), said, lit; let go, gone, whatever took the keys meanwhile; in PERFORM
# they still solo (on Stratosfear: both sequences from the first bar)
wait 300
turn PRESET 4
wait 300
expect piece 4
listen
wait 2000
key b0 down
wait 300
said Take-off
expect bfx >0
key b0 up
wait 300
expect bfx 0
# Rise (b8): the filters open, the Sequence's offset up; Close (b9): down
key b8 down
wait 2500
said Rise
expect fo1 >60
key b8 up
wait 5000
key b9 down
wait 2500
said Close
expect fo1 <-150
key b9 up
wait 6000
# a black key held, then REC pressed and the key let go under it: the effect ends
key b3 down
wait 300
press REC
wait 200
key b3 up
wait 200
release REC
wait 300
expect bfx 0
# held, then SEL tapped (PERFORM), let go: ends; in PERFORM the black keys solo
key b1 down
wait 300
tap SEL
wait 200
key b1 up
wait 300
expect bfx 0
tapkey b1
wait 300
said SOLO SEQ
tapkey b1
wait 300
tap SEL
wait 300
